{
  "name": "bleach-1000-year-blood-war",
  "description": "Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War: blood-red skies, crimson shadows, dark contrast.",
  "notes": "Sliders copied one-for-one from a Lightroom tutorial reel. Strongest on sunsets and dramatic skies. In Lightroom, blue skies turn fully crimson; here they land closer to magenta-purple.",
